management, config and policy
management, dev ops tooling, and

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:09.660
a robust marketplace, as you
saw yesterday, so that customers

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:13.840
can have a unified experience
when they consume the products

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:18.196
and services of independent
software vendors. And it works

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:22.450
equally well for your existing
